# =============================================================================
# GitHub = clean top-to-bottom guideline, NOT a data mirror.
# Keep: pipeline/ · analysis/new-v2/ (findings) · docs/ · guides/ ·
#       presentations/Flux_2026/ · scripts/ (legacy ref) · READMEs · the HTML.
# Everything below lives locally / on the clusters, not on GitHub.
# =============================================================================

# Claude Code session state
.claude/
**/.claude/

